                                        "entry_id": "75a5baa1-6717-34cc-bde4-18bb0d1eba46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The god of mischief and trickery; growing progressively evil, he kills Balder, and is bound until Ragnarok, the end of the world."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Norse"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5f7c432-a4b9-4ef9-8bbb-72768b409b21",
                                                "sense_id": "74a39596-6aab-3cff-b507-718708245523",
                                                "text": "There’s the Loki fly, in honor of the tortured God of Mischief, whose scientific name is “Daptolestes illusiolautus,” meaning elegant deception."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
